          "text": "GLITCH BREAKBEAT\n\n808 breakbeat pattern with fast glitch stutters.\n\n- 140 BPM with swing for groove\n- Syncopated kick/snare + busy HH\n- Drums mixed -> Glitch -> Distortion -> Out\n\nGlitch settings:\n- Prob 55% = over half the beats glitch\n- Slice 40ms = fast micro-stutters\n- Repeats 5 = machine gun fills\n- Reverse 35% = occasional reverse hits\n- Pitch 2st = subtle pitch warping\n\nThe distortion adds grit to the glitched beats.\n\nTry:\n- Tempo 160 = DnB speed\n- Prob 1.0 + Repeats 8 = total chaos\n- Remove distortion for cleaner sound\n- SliceMs 15 = granular texture"
